 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000409",
   "key": "lead",
   "section_type": "lead",
   "heading": null,
   "level": 2,
   "position": 0.0,
   "visibility": "public",
   "canon": "approved",
   "version": 1,
   "word_count": 33,
   "generated": false,
   "in_world": true,
   "author_canon": false,
   "source_ref": null,
   "body_md": "The Battle at the Ford was fought in the summer of YV 1020 at the ford below [[lampton]], in the [[war-of-the-ford|War of the Ford]]. The host of [[testmark]] under [[dirk]] broke the [[eastmarch|Eastmarch]].",
   "html": "<p>The Battle at the Ford was fought in the summer of YV 1020 at the ford below <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/lampton\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000031\" data-slug=\"lampton\">Lampton</a>, in the <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/war-of-the-ford\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000041\" data-slug=\"war-of-the-ford\">War of the Ford</a>. The host of <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/testmark\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000010\" data-slug=\"testmark\">Kingdom of Testmark</a> under <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/dirk\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000023\" data-slug=\"dirk\">Dirk</a> broke the <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/eastmarch\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000012\" data-slug=\"eastmarch\">Eastmarch</a>.</p>\n"
  },
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000410",
   "key": "history",
   "section_type": "history",
   "heading": "History",
   "level": 2,
   "position": 10.0,
   "visibility": "public",
   "canon": "approved",
   "version": 1,
   "word_count": 30,
   "generated": false,
   "in_world": true,
   "author_canon": false,
   "source_ref": null,
   "body_md": "The [[eastmarch|Eastmarch]] crossed at dawn. Dirk held the far bank until the river rose behind them. Accounts differ on who led: the court's chronicle names [[aldo]], the ballad names Dirk.",
   "html": "<p>The <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/eastmarch\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000012\" data-slug=\"eastmarch\">Eastmarch</a> crossed at dawn. Dirk held the far bank until the river rose behind them. Accounts differ on who led: the court's chronicle names <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/aldo\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000020\" data-slug=\"aldo\">Aldo</a>, the ballad names Dirk.</p>\n"
  },
