   "markdown": "- [[testmark-chronicle|Testmark Chronicle]] (YV 1022)\n  - According to Testmark Chronicle, Aldo commanded at Battle at the Ford for Kingdom of Testmark. (contradicts)\n- [[ballad-of-the-ford|Ballad of the Ford]] (the 1030s)\n  - According to Ballad of the Ford, Dirk commanded at Battle at the Ford for Kingdom of Testmark. (agrees)\n- [[ferrymans-rumour|The ferryman's rumour]] (YV 1052)\n  - According to The ferryman's rumour, Bera commanded at Battle at the Ford for Kingdom of Testmark. (invents)",
